% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: the cell is clipped to its box. The paint procedure paints
% well outside BBox; the captured cell carries the box as its clip and
% the pattern's steps and box as given.
/P << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 12 /YStep 8 /PaintProc { pop -5 -5 20 20 rectfill } >>
  matrix makepattern def
P setpattern
100 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
